EquivalentClasses(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0008193> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001474> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0010528>)))
